  "bodyHash": "b8f57c6696576c3f",
  "content": "\n\n<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/logo.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"130\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 此模組新增了多種特殊飾品，讓遊戲的某些環節更加有趣。<br>所有飾品的詳細說明可於 <a href=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MajruszsAccessories/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a> 查閱。<br><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">此模組需要安裝 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/majrusz-library\" rel=\"nofollow\">Majrusz Library</a> 才能運作！</span></strong><br></span> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/stuff.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>效率加成</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 所有飾品都具備隨機的效率加成，使其實用程度各異。<br>說明文字會動態生成，為您顯示包含效率加成後的最終數值。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/bonus.png?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>回收</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 所有多餘的重複飾品均可在特定村民的交易中出售。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/trades.png?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>提升效率加成</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 相同類型的多個飾品可以合併，以重新隨機生成效率加成。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/crafting.png?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>合併不同飾品</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 您可以將特定飾品合併，獲得包含所有加成的全新飾品。<br>部分加成在新飾品中甚至會更加強大！<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/crafting2.png?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>如何裝備飾品？</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 若您已安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets</a>，將飾品放入新增的「口袋」欄位即可生效。<br>否則，僅當手持於副手時才會生效。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/pocket_slot.png?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/pocket_slot2.png?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>還有更多特色！</strong><br></span> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/languages.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"185\"> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Accessories/thanks.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> - 中文翻譯：<a href=\"https://github.com/HaooooZhang\" rel=\"nofollow\">HaooooZhang</a><br>- 西班牙文翻譯：<a href=\"https://github.com/spliitbtw\" rel=\"nofollow\">spliitbtw</a><br>- 烏克蘭文翻譯：<a href=\"https://github.com/unroman\" rel=\"nofollow\">unroman</a><br>- 日文翻譯：もふざとう (mohuzato)<br></span> <br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UF774WcuW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Library/discord.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"138\"> </a> <br><a href=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MajruszsAccessories/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Library/mod_wiki.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"138\"> </a></h6>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
